WEBVTT

00:04.990 --> 00:07.500
<b>Sisbell, we'll come get you.</b>

00:09.800 --> 00:13.120
<b>The whole Sovereignty is in chaos.</b>

00:13.680 --> 00:17.380
<b>The area around the palace is packed 
with civilians and news reporters.</b>

00:17.760 --> 00:21.460
<b>It shows how shocking the 
Imperial army's attacks were.</b>

00:21.460 --> 00:24.590
<b>B-But last night's attack on the palace was...</b>

00:24.800 --> 00:29.030
<b>The queen was injured, and some including 
the royal family have gone missing.</b>

00:29.030 --> 00:32.930
<b>True, most of this was carried 
out by the Imperial army, but...</b>

00:32.930 --> 00:37.020
<b>The names of the masterminds, Hydra 
and Elletear, haven't been announced.</b>

00:37.020 --> 00:40.160
<b>We're the only ones who know the truth.</b>

00:40.160 --> 00:42.350
<b>Right now, everything's going 
according to their plan.</b>

00:42.590 --> 00:47.570
<b>Iska, there are most likely 
Hydra soldiers amongst them.</b>

00:47.570 --> 00:50.150
<b>If we go out, they'll notice us instantly.</b>

00:50.150 --> 00:54.580
<b>We need to hang back for a bit. 
We're a big group, after all.</b>

00:54.810 --> 00:59.730
<b>Vacation house was destroyed and the 
city's under watch by Hydra's assassins.</b>

00:59.730 --> 01:01.750
<b>I'd like to hear everyone's thoughts.</b>

01:02.130 --> 01:03.630
<b>This headline...</b>

01:05.710 --> 01:10.020
<b>It says: "Queen injured. Will she be replaced?"</b>

01:10.020 --> 01:12.070
<b>Please tell me this is a joke.</b>

01:12.070 --> 01:14.430
<b>Even the news is under Hydra's control?!</b>

01:14.680 --> 01:16.990
<b>Is there anywhere we can hide?</b>

01:20.500 --> 01:24.900
<b>We'll have no supplies, food, or water
if we stay in this forest.</b>

01:24.900 --> 01:28.440
<b>To be honest, we're all dead on our feet.</b>

01:28.440 --> 01:30.240
<b>We have no choice.</b>

01:30.240 --> 01:33.030
<b>We shall take refuge
in one of Lou's safe houses.</b>

01:33.030 --> 01:37.080
<b>Isn't it a place you prepared in 
case of war with the Imperial army?</b>

01:37.380 --> 01:40.660
<b>Are you sure it's okay to take
us Imperial soldiers, there?</b>

01:40.660 --> 01:42.920
<b>This is part of the deal.</b>

01:42.920 --> 01:45.330
<b>You, bring back Lady Sisbell.</b>

01:45.330 --> 01:47.710
<b>If you break that promise,</b>

01:47.710 --> 01:50.050
<b>you can take my life.</b>

01:50.050 --> 01:54.720
<b>That's why we stuck around. 
We're here to bring her back.</b>

01:55.210 --> 01:57.780
<b>Do not forget those words.</b>

01:57.780 --> 01:59.370
<b>We will take you...</b>

01:57.780 --> 01:59.370
<b>We will take you...</b>

01:57.780 --> 01:59.370
<b>We will take you...</b>

02:01.120 --> 02:02.980
<b>To our safe house.</b>

02:01.120 --> 02:02.980
<b>To our safe house.</b>

02:01.120 --> 02:02.980
<b>To our safe house.</b>

02:04.630 --> 02:09.510
<b>Acting Queen Aliceliese, the fire on 
the premises has been extinguished.</b>

02:04.830 --> 02:10.790
<b>Reclaim: The World Rises</b>

02:09.510 --> 02:13.650
<b>However, we are still 
searching for enemy forces.</b>

02:14.330 --> 02:18.860
<b>Thank you. We don't know where 
the Imperial soldiers are hiding.</b>

02:18.860 --> 02:21.300
<b>Minister, please proceed with 
the search with caution.</b>

02:21.300 --> 02:22.670
<b>Of course.</b>

02:25.620 --> 02:29.710
<b>It is highly unlikely that the 
Imperial army has retreated.</b>

02:30.190 --> 02:34.440
<b>Several members of the royal family, 
including Lady Elletear, have gone missing.</b>

02:34.880 --> 02:36.800
<b>We believe the Imperial army has taken them.</b>

02:37.150 --> 02:40.970
<b>They wanted to leave swiftly 
after achieving their goal.</b>

02:40.970 --> 02:45.870
<b>If anything was left behind, it'd be 
listening devices and bombs, not soldiers.</b>

02:46.410 --> 02:48.800
<b>We're also working on the 
removal of such objects.</b>

02:50.360 --> 02:53.550
<b>Lady Alice, you did all that you could.</b>

02:54.100 --> 02:55.950
<b>Please don't be too hard on yourself.</b>

02:56.950 --> 02:59.690
<b>Don't worry, I don't regret what I did.</b>

03:00.200 --> 03:03.400
<b>My focus is to ensure security of the palace,</b>

03:03.730 --> 03:06.500
<b>to provide an explanation 
for our anxious citizens,</b>

03:06.250 --> 03:08.290
<b>have a countermeasure against the Empire,</b>

03:08.290 --> 03:09.290
<b>and above all...</b>

03:09.590 --> 03:13.340
<b>Plan a rescue to get Lady Sisbell, 
who was kidnapped by the Hydras, back.</b>

03:13.830 --> 03:18.260
<b>What a terrible mess we're in.
It's even worse than thirty years ago.</b>

03:19.510 --> 03:22.020
<b>Masked Lord, you look...</b>

03:22.630 --> 03:27.650
<b>I was having a little dance 
with a rather mischievous lady.</b>

03:27.890 --> 03:29.480
<b>A Saint Disciple.</b>

03:29.720 --> 03:33.600
<b>Now then, I have some things to 
quickly report, acting Queen.</b>

03:33.600 --> 03:36.500
<b>The Tower of Moon is free of the Imperial army.</b>

03:36.810 --> 03:39.320
<b>Although we still need to see 
if they left behind any gifts.</b>

03:39.790 --> 03:41.560
<b>I'm glad you're all right.</b>

03:41.560 --> 03:45.040
<b>All right? I'm afraid you're mistaken.</b>

03:45.940 --> 03:48.590
<b>The royal palace has been 
trampled by the Imperial army.</b>

03:48.900 --> 03:53.090
<b>Beautiful gardens burned to ashes,
blood was spilled from many of our comrades,</b>

03:53.550 --> 03:56.220
<b>and several members of the 
royal family are missing.</b>

03:56.690 --> 03:58.550
<b>That includes the head of Zoa, Growley.</b>

03:59.770 --> 04:02.640
<b>The people are filled with anxiety and anger.</b>

04:02.640 --> 04:05.300
<b>How is any of this "all right"?</b>

04:06.260 --> 04:11.630
<b>The Zoa's have repeatedly advised the 
immediate attack against the Empire.</b>

04:12.110 --> 04:15.860
<b>The queen continued to refuse, 
and look at where that got us.</b>

04:16.640 --> 04:19.510
<b>The people are wanting a new queen as well.</b>

04:21.020 --> 04:26.060
<b>However, the House of Zoa must prioritize 
the search for our family head.</b>

04:26.060 --> 04:28.070
<b>Some things are questionable.</b>

04:28.470 --> 04:29.210
<b>What do you—</b>

04:29.210 --> 04:32.540
<b>Hello, forgive my tardiness.</b>

04:32.850 --> 04:34.300
<b>Lady Alice.</b>

04:34.550 --> 04:39.450
<b>I heard all about it. Lady Alice, 
this must be truly hard for you.</b>

04:39.450 --> 04:44.040
<b>Apparently, Lady Elletear and 
Lady Sisbell are missing?</b>

04:44.040 --> 04:48.600
<b>They are dear friends of mine.
I shall be praying for their safety.</b>

04:49.050 --> 04:51.970
<b>Yes, thank you.</b>

04:52.400 --> 04:57.290
<b>Ah, right, speaking of safety,
we're glad you're safe as well, Lord Talisman.</b>

04:57.290 --> 05:02.650
<b>By the way, rumor has is that only 
the House of Hydra was able to</b>

05:02.650 --> 05:04.990
<b>avoid the Imperial army's attack last night?</b>

05:04.990 --> 05:09.640
<b>Yes, they focused their forces here
at the Royal Palace.</b>

05:09.640 --> 05:12.540
<b>It seems the Hydras weren't 
even on their radar.</b>

05:15.860 --> 05:18.280
<b>Thank goodness for small mercies.</b>

05:18.280 --> 05:20.490
<b>By the way, I would like to ask for your help.</b>

05:20.950 --> 05:24.640
<b>Do you know anything about the whereabouts 
of our family head, Growley?</b>

05:24.640 --> 05:26.840
<b>I'm afraid not.</b>

05:26.840 --> 05:30.100
<b>However, the House of Hydra 
will also send a search party.</b>

05:30.390 --> 05:33.710
<b>Thank you. I'll be leaving now.</b>

05:34.600 --> 05:40.110
<b>Lady Alice, with the fall of the queen, 
this nation will be greatly shaken.</b>

05:40.460 --> 05:44.370
<b>This will prove to be a difficult challenge, 
but we shall overcome it together.</b>

05:44.650 --> 05:46.960
<b>Thank you for your thoughtfulness.</b>

05:50.840 --> 05:51.900
<b>Lady Alice!</b>

05:53.650 --> 05:55.620
<b>The queen has awakened.</b>

05:55.620 --> 05:56.960
<b>Mother has?!</b>

05:57.310 --> 05:59.750
<b>The surgery on her arm was a success.</b>

05:59.750 --> 06:03.630
<b>The anesthetic hasn't completely worn off,
but she should be able to talk.</b>

06:04.210 --> 06:05.720
<b>I'm on my way.</b>

06:06.050 --> 06:07.360
<b>I'll do as you've planned.</b>

06:07.920 --> 06:10.240
<b>Please take care of the queen.</b>

06:11.680 --> 06:17.110
<b>I'm a disappointment.
When did I become so weak?</b>

06:17.960 --> 06:19.780
<b>I'm unfit to be a queen.</b>

06:21.210 --> 06:23.440
<b>I couldn't protect the palace,</b>

06:23.440 --> 06:28.490
<b>and allowed Sisbell and Elletear to 
fall into the hands of the Empire.</b>

06:28.490 --> 06:31.750
<b>Mother, I have something important to tell you.</b>

06:32.180 --> 06:35.070
<b>I'm prepared for the bad news.</b>

06:35.510 --> 06:40.000
<b>I'm also ready for my daughter 
to scold me for my failures.</b>

06:40.370 --> 06:41.960
<b>Allow me to speak freely, then.</b>

06:42.440 --> 06:46.840
<b>We need to get Sisbell back.
Not from the Empire, but from Hydra.</b>

06:47.940 --> 06:49.050
<b>What did you say?!</b>

06:49.320 --> 06:52.770
<b>The Hydras brought 
the Imperial army to this nation.</b>

06:52.770 --> 06:58.040
<b>Hydras disguised as Imperial soldiers 
have attacked our vacation house.</b>

06:58.040 --> 07:00.900
<b>Vichyssoise was the one that took Sisbell.</b>

07:01.150 --> 07:02.990
<b>Can I trust you?</b>

07:03.300 --> 07:06.110
<b>I swear by my right to the queen's succession.</b>

07:06.570 --> 07:08.690
<b>They will stop at nothing.</b>

07:09.160 --> 07:14.100
<b>I had my suspicions that the Hydras 
were behind the Queen's Hall explosion.</b>

07:14.100 --> 07:19.030
<b>That was why I wanted to reveal the 
mastermind with Sisbell's power,</b>

07:19.410 --> 07:22.070
<b>but I never imagined they would 
bring in the Imperial army.</b>

07:22.920 --> 07:27.260
<b>Yes. The Lou vacation house was 
also destroyed by Vichyssoise.</b>

07:27.260 --> 07:28.930
<b>The people at the vacation house...</b>

07:28.930 --> 07:31.630
<b>They're all safe.
They escaped in the nick of time.</b>

07:32.160 --> 07:38.980
<b>I see. However, even if Talisman was 
behind this, we have no proof...</b>

07:38.980 --> 07:43.730
<b>We have two masterminds. The person who 
brought in the Imperial army here...</b>

07:44.330 --> 07:45.610
<b>was Elletear.</b>

07:46.920 --> 07:47.780
<b>Go on.</b>

07:48.130 --> 07:52.780
<b>Sisbell can testify. The Hydras 
feared this, and kidnapped her.</b>

07:55.940 --> 07:59.780
<b>Elletear was behaving suspiciously.</b>

07:59.780 --> 08:02.290
<b>You must've suspected her as well, Mother.</b>

08:03.040 --> 08:08.880
<b>I can think of some things. If this 
is true, as long as Sisbell is safe,</b>

08:08.880 --> 08:13.680
<b>we can shed light on Hydra's conspiracy 
with her astral art of illumination.</b>

08:14.530 --> 08:17.020
<b>Right. Rin is already on the move.</b>

08:17.570 --> 08:21.190
<b>As long as we have the location, 
we can bring Sisbell back.</b>

08:21.850 --> 08:27.270
<b>Mother, do you have any idea where 
the Hydras could be hiding Sisbell?</b>

08:29.230 --> 08:33.700
<b>Why are the Hydras keeping me here?</b>

08:33.700 --> 08:34.660
<b>I know!</b>

08:35.100 --> 08:39.940
<b>If I reenact how I got here, 
maybe I can find some clues...</b>

08:41.500 --> 08:42.330
<b>Huh?!</b>

08:45.610 --> 08:48.130
<b>Enough with the theatrics and show yourself!</b>

08:48.710 --> 08:53.260
<b>You'll pay for this, Hydra. I will 
make sure we get Lady Sisbell back.</b>

08:54.350 --> 08:56.060
<b>This is where they took refuge?</b>

08:59.490 --> 09:01.850
<b>It's me. Is everyone okay?</b>

09:02.160 --> 09:03.110
<b>Rin!</b>

09:03.400 --> 09:08.580
<b>Rin! I'm so sorry, they took Lady Sisbell.</b>

09:09.020 --> 09:13.930
<b>It'll be fine. Lady Alice and the 
queen were glad you all survived.</b>

09:14.390 --> 09:16.170
<b>Thank you.</b>

09:16.170 --> 09:18.580
<b>I'm glad to hear the queen is safe.</b>

09:19.570 --> 09:21.390
<b>We're going to get Lady Sisbell back.</b>

09:21.830 --> 09:24.500
<b>Lady Alice and the queen are 
currently working on a plan.</b>

09:24.840 --> 09:30.090
<b>About that, Lady Sisbell's 
escorts are offering their help.</b>

09:30.090 --> 09:35.750
<b>Right. We can trust those four more 
than our soldiers. Where are they?</b>

09:35.750 --> 09:36.810
<b>In the back.</b>

09:38.990 --> 09:40.680
<b>Oh, Rin.</b>

09:40.680 --> 09:42.090
<b>Where's Iska?</b>

09:42.090 --> 09:47.020
<b>He's in the room at the very back.
Oh, but I think Iska is—</b>

09:47.020 --> 09:50.380
<b>Imperial swordsman, break time's over!</b>

09:50.380 --> 09:52.100
<b>It's me, I'm coming in.</b>

09:52.520 --> 09:56.120
<b>Is that Rin?! H-Hold on, I'll be right there.</b>

09:56.120 --> 09:57.860
<b>I can't hold on. I'm coming in.</b>

09:57.860 --> 09:59.910
<b>J-Just give me a minute.</b>

09:59.910 --> 10:03.790
<b>This is suspicious. What are you up to?!</b>

10:04.050 --> 10:08.210
<b>I'm not up to anything! I'm not,
but I'm a little busy right now and—</b>

10:08.210 --> 10:10.510
<b>Shut up, I'm coming in!</b>

10:14.620 --> 10:17.030
<b>I was taking a shower...</b>

10:20.140 --> 10:23.390
<b>Imperial swordsman!</b>

10:23.390 --> 10:26.400
<b>You! How dare you...</b>

10:26.400 --> 10:29.140
<b>W-Wait, Rin! Let's talk about this!</b>

10:29.140 --> 10:31.010
<b>How dare you show your naked body!</b>

10:32.000 --> 10:36.410
<b>What a pervert! Walking around like that!</b>

10:37.030 --> 10:38.160
<b>Hey, watch it!</b>

10:38.160 --> 10:40.400
<b>You should watch your nudity!</b>

10:40.800 --> 10:42.750
<b>I'm trying to get some clothes on!</b>

10:43.480 --> 10:46.520
<b>I'm a 17-year-old lady.</b>

10:46.520 --> 10:49.830
<b>How are you going to take responsibility?!</b>

10:49.830 --> 10:52.560
<b>You're the one who barged in without permission!</b>

10:54.540 --> 10:59.380
<b>Fine, get dressed. Listen to what I 
have to say while getting dressed.</b>

10:59.380 --> 11:03.850
<b>Yesterday, our palace was under
attack by the Imperial army.</b>

11:04.110 --> 11:05.230
<b>I know.</b>

11:05.230 --> 11:10.160
<b>Lady Alice is aware that Hydra was the 
one responsible behind the scenes.</b>

11:10.560 --> 11:12.690
<b>Apparently you informed her?</b>

11:13.170 --> 11:14.900
<b>You're not wrong.</b>

11:22.820 --> 11:26.150
<b>Then you must know why I'm here.</b>

11:26.660 --> 11:29.210
<b>You're to help us get Lady Sisbell back.</b>

11:29.550 --> 11:34.760
<b>You don't have to tell us. 
That's why we're here.</b>

11:35.710 --> 11:38.060
<b>Hey, Sisbell!</b>

11:40.460 --> 11:41.640
<b>You!</b>

11:41.640 --> 11:47.020
<b>Do you understand your situation now?
Too bad you're all alone here.</b>

11:48.630 --> 11:50.730
<b>They'll come for me.</b>

11:52.120 --> 11:56.680
<b>Who? Your sister? Or those guys from the Empire?</b>

11:58.710 --> 12:02.580
<b>You're tougher than I thought. 
I figured you'd be scared.</b>

12:02.580 --> 12:06.990
<b>But you're still sweet, compared to your sister.</b>

12:08.380 --> 12:11.270
<b>Congratulations on your escape, Vichyssoise.</b>

12:11.270 --> 12:14.270
<b>You broke out of the prison in 
the middle of all the commotion.</b>

12:14.270 --> 12:18.240
<b>I suppose you had nothing 
to worry about, though.</b>

12:18.240 --> 12:24.060
<b>I'm so jealous of your power. 
With that power, you're fearless.</b>

12:24.310 --> 12:29.480
<b>Please. You're a more 
frightening monster than I am.</b>

12:31.380 --> 12:33.960
<b>So you aren't going to deny you're a monster?</b>

12:33.960 --> 12:37.740
<b>Well, then. I guess I'll go capture Sisbell.</b>

12:38.230 --> 12:40.320
<b>Just don't hurt her.</b>

12:40.540 --> 12:43.600
<b>Huh? That doesn't even make sense.</b>

12:43.600 --> 12:47.620
<b>You betrayed the Sovereignty, but now 
you want to show mercy on your family?</b>

12:48.000 --> 12:52.420
<b>It's because this is the last 
time I'll be seeing my family.</b>

12:52.420 --> 12:54.840
<b>Can't a girl get a little sentimental?</b>

12:56.160 --> 13:00.200
<b>A love and hate relationship? You wanna 
destroy it, but you also love it?</b>

13:00.200 --> 13:04.970
<b>What a drag! If you can't bring 
yourself to do it, I'll—</b>

13:05.380 --> 13:10.190
<b>Vichyssoise, if you lay a finger on my sister,</b>

13:12.060 --> 13:15.030
<b>I'll crush Hydra right here and now.</b>

13:16.230 --> 13:18.690
<b>You'd betray my family?</b>

13:19.270 --> 13:22.150
<b>My cooperation comes with three conditions.</b>

13:22.150 --> 13:27.270
<b>As long as you keep them, we can 
maintain this pleasant relationship.</b>

13:27.270 --> 13:30.760
<b>Wouldn't that be better for you,
and for Lord Talisman?</b>

13:32.890 --> 13:36.130
<b>After all, I am a monster.</b>

13:37.050 --> 13:39.190
<b>I just remembered something unpleasant.</b>

13:39.800 --> 13:42.040
<b>Get up, little princess.</b>

13:42.040 --> 13:44.420
<b>Schwartz better be all right.</b>

13:44.800 --> 13:48.490
<b>Hm? Oh, that old geezer.</b>

13:48.970 --> 13:52.120
<b>He's safe as long as you 
do what we tell you to do.</b>

13:52.120 --> 13:53.490
<b>What are you going to make me do?!</b>

13:53.490 --> 13:56.120
<b>That's going to be a surprise after you wake up.</b>

13:59.610 --> 14:04.320
<b>So much security. Did some 
drunk guy get into a fight?</b>

14:04.320 --> 14:06.720
<b>This is our doing, of course.</b>

14:06.720 --> 14:11.160
<b>The whole world would panic if the 
Imperial army attacked the Sovereignty.</b>

14:12.230 --> 14:14.880
<b>But it has nothing to do 
with the neutral cities.</b>

14:15.240 --> 14:20.530
<b>Is this detour really necessary to 
throw the Sovereignty off our tail?</b>

14:21.130 --> 14:25.590
<b>Don't you have to immediately 
return to the Emperor, Risya?</b>

14:25.590 --> 14:28.640
<b>Yes, but while gathering intel.</b>

14:29.040 --> 14:31.930
<b>All according to the Eight 
Great Apostle's vision.</b>

14:32.440 --> 14:35.700
<b>Your Majesty, you must wake up soon.</b>

14:37.790 --> 14:44.220
<b>Looks like you were busy while the 
Eight Great Apostle Meln was asleep.</b>

14:44.860 --> 14:50.200
<b>A moth that flies too close to 
fire is destined to burn to ashes.</b>

14:50.430 --> 14:53.960
<b>That power is too great for a human to wield.</b>

14:54.420 --> 14:56.370
<b>Will the Sovereignty retaliate?</b>

14:56.370 --> 14:57.880
<b>Improbable.</b>

14:57.880 --> 15:01.030
<b>If the descendants of the Founder have 
even a little bit of intelligence,</b>

15:01.030 --> 15:03.590
<b>they will clearly understand that now 
is not the time to bare their fangs.</b>

15:03.890 --> 15:09.540
<b>The injured queen, captured purebreds,
panicked citizens...</b>

15:09.540 --> 15:11.880
<b>Their retaliation will come later.</b>

15:11.880 --> 15:14.390
<b>Get a move on your research, Kelvina.</b>

15:14.670 --> 15:19.270
<b>Five points. A shriveled old 
tree has no value as a sample.</b>

15:19.600 --> 15:22.540
<b>So? Has she awakened?</b>

15:22.540 --> 15:25.650
<b>Subject E was your biggest failure.</b>

15:25.960 --> 15:28.770
<b>Let us repeat. Make haste with your research.</b>

15:28.770 --> 15:32.340
<b>Before that subject evolves into a monster.</b>

15:32.340 --> 15:35.080
<b>Then give me a better sample next time.</b>

15:35.080 --> 15:40.420
<b>We will give you everything.
Your mission is to create a true witch.</b>

15:40.660 --> 15:41.910
<b>All right.</b>

15:47.250 --> 15:50.390
<b>Stay here. We're returning 
to the Empire territory.</b>

15:50.640 --> 15:54.790
<b>Of course. I know my place as a prisoner.</b>

15:55.470 --> 15:59.980
<b>What a great day. Finally,
the Sovereignty is overthrown.</b>

16:00.380 --> 16:01.960
<b>This is day one.</b>

16:02.740 --> 16:04.690
<b>It was so painful.</b>

16:04.690 --> 16:08.850
<b>So painful, and yet I couldn't die.</b>

16:09.440 --> 16:10.570
<b>You there.</b>

16:11.540 --> 16:12.780
<b>W-What do you want?!</b>

16:12.780 --> 16:17.390
<b>I have a request.
 Could I get some water, please?</b>

16:17.850 --> 16:20.460
<b>As you can see, my body is on fire.</b>

16:21.730 --> 16:23.840
<b>I'll get you something from our supply.</b>

16:24.490 --> 16:26.040
<b>Thank you.</b>

16:28.140 --> 16:32.910
<b>Hello, Lady Elletear. I see your 
communication device was not confiscated.</b>

16:33.310 --> 16:36.700
<b>I appreciate your concern, Lord Talisman.</b>

16:36.700 --> 16:39.060
<b>I was able to make it out safely.</b>

16:39.560 --> 16:41.350
<b>How is the Sovereignty?</b>

16:41.350 --> 16:43.820
<b>As planned, they're in chaos.</b>

16:44.150 --> 16:49.400
<b>The Sovereignty has suffered great 
damage from the Imperial army's attack.</b>

16:49.640 --> 16:54.870
<b>The queen's election and the rise 
of the new queen will happen soon.</b>

16:54.870 --> 16:57.410
<b>You sound weak.</b>

16:57.700 --> 16:59.760
<b>Thank you for being so considerate.</b>

17:00.210 --> 17:04.250
<b>Torn between a human and a witch. Such sorrow.</b>

17:05.410 --> 17:06.250
<b>What's wrong?!</b>

17:14.360 --> 17:16.630
<b>Is it time for my snack yet?</b>

17:16.630 --> 17:18.100
<b>Huh? Your Majesty...?</b>

17:16.640 --> 17:18.100
<b>Huh? Your Majesty...?</b>

17:18.100 --> 17:19.930
<b>No, that wasn't...</b>

17:21.490 --> 17:22.600
<b>Elletear!</b>

17:27.080 --> 17:29.530
<b>That's enough, Lady Elletear.</b>

17:30.050 --> 17:32.320
<b>We have a meeting to go to.</b>

17:50.900 --> 17:54.150
<b>Princess Aliceliese's astral 
art is extraordinary.</b>

17:54.150 --> 17:56.290
<b>She is the leading candidate for the queen.</b>

17:56.290 --> 18:00.820
<b>No, Lady Sisbell's "illumination" 
is fit for a queen of the new age.</b>

18:02.990 --> 18:06.680
<b>Only those with a strong astral 
spirit are worthy of praise.</b>

18:07.430 --> 18:10.610
<b>This nation isn't an astral mage's paradise.</b>

18:12.080 --> 18:13.660
<b>I hate it.</b>

18:15.550 --> 18:24.740
<b>I'm a bad witch, so I want 
the sovereignty to collapse.</b>

18:26.490 --> 18:28.800
<b>This will be our new base.</b>

18:29.020 --> 18:31.890
<b>Is it because the other safe house 
was too far from the palace,</b>

18:31.890 --> 18:34.840
<b>making it inconvenient to 
sneak into Hydra's facilities?</b>

18:35.280 --> 18:40.050
<b>It's also easier for Lady Alice to visit.
She'll be here any moment.</b>

18:40.050 --> 18:44.850
<b>Alice is coming? Is it okay for her 
to leave the castle right now?</b>

18:44.850 --> 18:47.020
<b>Of course it isn't okay.</b>

18:47.620 --> 18:50.280
<b>In place of the injured queen,</b>

18:50.280 --> 18:53.990
<b>Lady Alice is working very hard 
and going without sleep as the acting queen.</b>

18:54.400 --> 18:58.440
<b>However, Lady Sisbell's life 
depends on our mission as well.</b>

18:58.440 --> 19:03.750
<b>With Sisbell back, Hydra's conspiracy 
can be proven with her astral art.</b>

19:04.030 --> 19:06.000
<b>That's right.</b>

19:08.350 --> 19:10.250
<b>You look pretty tired.</b>

19:10.530 --> 19:13.380
<b>I haven't slept for over two days.</b>

19:13.380 --> 19:17.810
<b>The queen has fallen, and Lady 
Alice is busy as acting Queen.</b>

19:17.810 --> 19:20.100
<b>My job is to assist her.</b>

19:20.100 --> 19:23.760
<b>I get that, but maybe you can get some rest.</b>

19:24.960 --> 19:27.580
<b>Lady Alice is fighting hard.</b>

19:27.580 --> 19:32.580
<b>As her servant... I cannot... give into...</b>

19:34.420 --> 19:36.550
<b>Shleep right... meow...</b>

19:36.550 --> 19:38.450
<b>You're not yourself!</b>

19:38.450 --> 19:43.290
<b>Hey, pull yourself together, Rin! 
Alice is on her way here, right?!</b>

19:44.200 --> 19:46.070
<b>Please take care of my mother.</b>

19:46.070 --> 19:47.040
<b>Of course!</b>

19:53.840 --> 19:57.830
<b>I'm a little nervous to see 
Iska again, and so soon.</b>

20:03.600 --> 20:08.660
<b>Okay, sorry to make you wait, Iska and Rin!
We need to plan a rescue mission—</b>

20:09.400 --> 20:13.590
<b>Huh? I was told this was 
the strategy meeting room.</b>

20:13.590 --> 20:18.190
<b>Really, Iska and Rin.
You need to learn to be on time.</b>

20:24.800 --> 20:27.380
<b>Jeez, how much longer?</b>

20:28.090 --> 20:32.550
<b>Now that I think about it,
I haven't slept for over two days...</b>

20:34.220 --> 20:38.880
<b>Oh, no... Lack of sleep is 
finally catching up to me...</b>

20:39.510 --> 20:42.100
<b>No, I can't doze off.</b>

20:42.100 --> 20:46.100
<b>But maybe I'll lie down until 
Rin and Iska get here...</b>

20:46.770 --> 20:48.900
<b>And close my eyes for a little bit...</b>

20:49.470 --> 20:53.510
<b>Only because the sun's so bright...</b>

20:58.260 --> 21:00.250
<b>Jhin, it's time for our meeting.</b>

21:00.250 --> 21:02.910
<b>I'm checking the documents. I'll be right there.</b>

21:03.420 --> 21:06.340
<b>Captain Mismis, Nene, it's time for our meeting.</b>

21:06.340 --> 21:08.450
<b>I can't find the files!</b>

21:08.450 --> 21:11.750
<b>Iska, go on ahead. We'll be right there.</b>

21:08.780 --> 21:11.750
<b>Jeez, where did it go?</b>

21:12.330 --> 21:17.380
<b>Rin is needed but also out, so I 
guess it's up to us and Alice...</b>

21:23.610 --> 21:27.060
<b>Alice?! Alice, are you all right?!</b>

21:27.580 --> 21:30.670
<b>She's unconscious. Who got to her?</b>

21:30.670 --> 21:33.070
<b>Was it a Hydra assassin?!</b>

21:33.770 --> 21:34.890
<b>Wait...</b>

21:36.070 --> 21:38.400
<b>Is she just asleep?</b>

21:41.810 --> 21:43.820
<b>Alice, are you up?</b>

21:44.300 --> 21:47.590
<b>Rin, let's sleep together.</b>

21:48.780 --> 21:51.660
<b>Come on, stop fighting me.</b>

21:50.390 --> 21:51.660
<b>Ah, wait!</b>

21:52.490 --> 21:57.380
<b>This is bad. This is really, really bad.</b>

21:58.340 --> 22:02.380
<b>Alice, we can't do this.</b>

22:02.820 --> 22:09.680
<b>Wow. You're so hot today, Rin.
You're going to burn me.</b>

22:10.030 --> 22:14.580
<b>What are you saying?! Alice,
if you're awake, could you move away?</b>

22:15.300 --> 22:18.500
<b>I can't believe I fell asleep.</b>

22:19.000 --> 22:22.870
<b>Hey! Pull yourself together, Rin!</b>

22:19.510 --> 22:22.870
<b>I needed to tidy up the room 
before Lady Alice arrives—</b>

22:22.870 --> 22:23.610
<b>Oh.</b>

22:24.200 --> 22:24.850
<b>Oh.</b>

22:27.470 --> 22:32.410
<b>Lady Alice... Imperial soldier... You...</b>

22:32.410 --> 22:33.330
<b>It isn't like that!</b>

22:33.560 --> 22:35.330
<b>I haven't said anything yet.</b>

22:35.580 --> 22:37.870
<b>I didn't do anything to Alice!</b>

22:37.870 --> 22:40.090
<b>She was just lying here!</b>

22:40.090 --> 22:41.710
<b>She was just lying there?!</b>

22:41.990 --> 22:42.760
<b>Exactly!</b>

22:42.760 --> 22:45.450
<b>So you threw yourself at
Lady Alice who was lying there,</b>

22:45.450 --> 22:50.310
<b>and driven by lust, you toyed with 
Lady Alice's voluptuous figure?!</b>

22:51.330 --> 22:52.640
<b>That's not it!</b>

22:52.920 --> 22:54.380
<b>Never mind! Get off of her!</b>

22:54.380 --> 22:56.210
<b>You're too close!</b>

22:56.210 --> 22:58.080
<b>Alice is the one hugging me!</b>

22:58.080 --> 22:58.750
<b>Shut up!</b>

22:58.750 --> 23:02.150
<b>Oh, jeez! We're going to have 
a strategy meeting, right?!</b>

23:01.120 --> 23:02.530
<b>You pervert!</b>

23:09.130 --> 23:12.870
<b>So we can officially ask you to rescue Sisbell?</b>

23:13.090 --> 23:15.080
<b>We've been saying that from the start.</b>

23:15.080 --> 23:17.680
<b>It became our responsibility when 
we accepted her escort.</b>

23:18.110 --> 23:20.750
<b>I also want to make sure 
what our situation is like.</b>

23:21.200 --> 23:26.410
<b>Hydra's the mastermind in all of this,
but the Imperial army did attack the palace.</b>

23:26.410 --> 23:31.360
<b>That should mean anyone from the Empire 
found here is to be immediately detained.</b>

23:31.360 --> 23:33.020
<b>Including us, of course.</b>

23:33.450 --> 23:35.200
<b>Your understanding is correct.</b>

23:36.300 --> 23:38.350
<b>During the battle against the Imperial army,</b>

23:38.350 --> 23:42.650
<b>many of our comrades were 
injured or went missing.</b>

23:43.030 --> 23:45.700
<b>No matter who, Imperial soldiers 
deserve to be executed.</b>

23:46.220 --> 23:49.160
<b>Even if they're Lady Sisbell's escorts.</b>

23:49.930 --> 23:52.910
<b>This is our public stance. 
But here's the condition.</b>

23:54.680 --> 23:56.830
<b>Remember, this is an extremely 
special exception.</b>

23:56.830 --> 23:59.700
<b>Normally, we would show no 
mercy to Imperial soldiers,</b>

24:00.090 --> 24:01.720
<b>but only for you four,</b>

24:01.720 --> 24:05.700
<b>your safety is guaranteed while you're 
in the search party to find Lady Sisbell.</b>

24:05.700 --> 24:06.760
<b>Was this all right?</b>

24:07.090 --> 24:10.790
<b>Yes. If you succeed in rescuing Sisbell,</b>

24:11.140 --> 24:13.890
<b>we will promise your safety 
until you cross the border.</b>

24:14.470 --> 24:16.180
<b>Does that work for you, Captain?</b>

24:16.400 --> 24:18.980
<b>Yes. We intend to rescue her anyway.</b>

24:19.570 --> 24:21.650
<b>Everyone good with this?</b>

24:23.490 --> 24:26.070
<b>We took a beating from the House of Hydra.</b>

24:26.070 --> 24:29.550
<b>We won't be turning down an 
opportunity to get back at them.</b>
